	"nodes":[
		{"id":"a4b4ae45e44aaecf","x":-320,"y":-212,"width":940,"height":3972,"type":"text","text":"┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐  \n│                         FRONTEND LAYER                               │  \n├─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤  \n│                                                                      │  \n│  ┌────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐   │  \n│  │  Chat UI (React )                           │   │  \n│  │  ├─ Message Thread                                         │   │  \n│  │  ├─ Rich Media Support (charts, tables, graphs)           │   │  \n│  │  ├─ Interactive Widgets (approve/reject buttons)          │   │  \n│  │  ├─ Code Snippets (SQL, Python)                           │   │  \n│  │  ├─ Data Previews                                          │   │  \n│  │  └─ Multimodal Input (text, voice, file upload)           │   │  \n│  └────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘   │  \n│                                                                      │  \n└──────────────────────────┬───────────────────────────────────────────┘  \n                           │  \n┌──────────────────────────▼───────────────────────────────────────────┐  \n│                    CONVERSATION ORCHESTRATOR                         │  \n├─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤  \n│                                                                      │  \n│  ┌────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐   │  \n│  │  Intent Recognition & Routing                              │   │  \n│  │  ├─ NLU Engine                            │   │  \n│  │  ├─ Intent Classifier                                      │   │  \n│  │  ├─ Entity Extraction                                      │   │  \n│  │  └─ Context Manager (conversation history)                │   │  \n│  └────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘   │  \n│                                                                      │  \n│  ┌────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐   │  \n│  │  Agent Router                                               │   │  \n│  │  Determines which specialized agent to invoke              │   │  \n│  └────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘   │  \n│                                                                      │  \n└──────────────────────────┬───────────────────────────────────────────┘  \n                           │  \n        ┌──────────────────┼──────────────────┐  \n        │                  │                  │  \n┌───────▼────────┐ ┌──────▼───────┐ ┌───────▼────────┐  \n│  Data Quality  │ │     MDM      │ │    Lineage     │                     \n│     Agent      │ │    Agent     │ │     Agent      │  \n└───────┬────────┘ └──────┬───────┘ └───────┬────────┘  \n        │                  │                  │  \n        └──────────────────┼──────────────────┘  \n                           │  \n┌──────────────────────────▼───────────────────────────────────────────┐  \n│                      SPECIALIZED AGENTS                              │  \n├─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤  \n│                                                                      │  \n│  1. Data Quality Agent    - Quality checks, profiling, anomalies    │  \n│  2. MDM Agent             - Duplicates, golden records, merging       │  \n│  3. Lineage Agent         - Trace data, impact analysis                         │  \n│  4. Schema Agent          - Data Vault structure, mappings               │  \n│  5. ETL Agent             - Pipeline status, job monitoring                     │  \n│  6. Query Agent           - Natural language to SQL                              │  \n│  7. Analytics Agent       - Generate insights, visualizations              │  \n│  8. Admin Agent           - Configuration, user management            │  \n│                                                                      │  \n└──────────────────────────┬───────────────────────────────────────────┘  \n                           │  \n┌──────────────────────────▼───────────────────────────────────────────┐  \n│                    BACKEND SERVICES LAYER                            │  \n├─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤  \n│                                                                      │  \n│  ├─ SSOT API (FastAPI)                                              │  \n│  ├─ Data Vault (PostgreSQL)                                         │  \n│  ├─ Elasticsearch                                                   │  \n│  ├─ MDM Engine                                                      │  \n│  ├─ Quality Engine                                                  │  \n│  └─ Metadata Registry                                               │  \n│                                                                      │  \n└─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘\n\nexample chat convo? how to show the data ask queries in chat based \n\nCapabilities:  \n├─ Trace data from source to consumption  \n├─ Show transformation logic  \n├─ Impact analysis (downstream/upstream)  \n├─ Visualize data flow  \n├─ Identify data dependencies  \n└─ Generate lineage reports\n\nExample Conversations:  \n─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\n\n👤: \"Where does customer email come from?\"\n\n🤖: Tracing lineage for customer.email...\n\n    📍 Current Location: gold.customers.email  \n  \n    ⬆️  Upstream Lineage:  \n  \n    gold.customers.email  \n      └─ silver.hub_customer.email (Data Vault)  \n          ├─ raw.salesforce.contact.email (Source 1)  \n          │   └─ Salesforce API Connector  \n          │       └─ Last synced: 2025-01-08 14:23 UTC  \n          │  \n          ├─ raw.sap_customers.email_address (Source 2)  \n          │   └─ SAP ECC Database (Direct Connect)  \n          │       └─ Last synced: 2025-01-08 14:15 UTC  \n          │  \n          └─ raw.oracle_crm.cust_email (Source 3)  \n              └─ Oracle Database (CDC via Debezium)  \n                  └─ Last synced: 2025-01-08 14:30 UTC\n\n    🔄 Transformations Applied:  \n    1. Validation (dbt model: stg_customer_email)  \n       - Email format validation (regex)  \n       - Duplicate check  \n       - Null handling  \n  \n    2. Deduplication (dbt model: int_customer_dedupe)  \n       - MDM golden record selection  \n       - Survivorship rules: Most recent + most complete  \n  \n    3. Enrichment (dbt model: gold_customers)  \n       - Email domain validation  \n       - Spam detection flag  \n       - Verification status\n\n    ⬇️  Downstream Usage:  \n    • Marketing database (12 campaigns active)  \n    • Analytics warehouse (15 dashboards)  \n    • CRM system sync (Salesforce)  \n    • Email service provider (SendGrid)\n\n    [🗺️ Visualize Full Graph] [⚠️ Impact Analysis] [📊 Quality Metrics]\n\n─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\n\n👤: \"What happens if SAP email changes?\"\n\n🤖: Running impact analysis for SAP email changes...\n\n    📊 Impact Assessment:\n\n    Immediate Impact:  \n    ✓ Change captured by CDC within 30 seconds  \n    ✓ Data Vault satellite updated (append-only)  \n    ✓ Elasticsearch index refreshed\n\n    Dependent Systems (15 total):  \n  \n    🔴 Critical (4):  \n       • gold.customers table - Updated in next ETL (15 min)  \n       • Email Marketing Platform - Synced hourly  \n       • Customer Support Portal - Real-time (via API)  \n       • Billing System - Updated daily (next run: 02:00 UTC)  \n  \n    🟡 Medium Priority (7):  \n       • Analytics Warehouse - Updated nightly  \n       • ML Models - Retrained weekly  \n       • Data Lake - Synced daily  \n       • Backup systems - Next backup: 00:00 UTC  \n       ... 3 more  \n  \n    🟢 Low Priority (4):  \n       • Archive storage - Monthly sync  \n       • Historical reports - Static  \n       ... 2 more\n\n    ⏱️  Estimated Propagation Time:  \n    • 50% systems updated: 15 minutes  \n    • 90% systems updated: 1 hour  \n    • 100% systems updated: 24 hours\n\n    ⚠️  Potential Issues:  \n    • Email Marketing: Campaign in-flight may use old email  \n    • Billing System: Invoice scheduled before update\n\n    [🔔 Set Alert] [📧 Notify Stakeholders] [🚀 Trigger Manual Sync]"},
		{"id":"23e63cd104745e93","x":2920,"y":-100,"width":1000,"height":2880,"type":"text","text":"```JSON\n{\n  \"$schema\": \"http://json-schema.org/draft-07/schema#\",\n  \"title\": \"UnifiedBronzeSchema\",\n  \"type\": \"object\",\n  \"required\": [\"metadata\", \"payload\"],\n  \n  \"properties\": {\n    \"metadata\": {\n      \"type\": \"object\",\n      \"required\": [\"record_id\", \"source_system\", \"ingestion_timestamp\", \"data_type\"],\n      \"properties\": {\n        \"record_id\": {\n          \"type\": \"string\",\n          \"description\": \"UUID for this record\"\n        },\n        \"source_system\": {\n          \"type\": \"string\",\n          \"description\": \"Origin system identifier\"\n        },\n        \"source_table\": {\n          \"type\": \"string\",\n          \"description\": \"Source table/collection/topic name\"\n        },\n        \"ingestion_timestamp\": {\n          \"type\": \"string\",\n          \"format\": \"date-time\"\n        },\n        \"data_type\": {\n          \"type\": \"string\",\n          \"enum\": [\"structured\", \"unstructured\", \"streaming\"]\n        },\n        \"operation\": {\n          \"type\": \"string\",\n          \"enum\": [\"INSERT\", \"UPDATE\", \"DELETE\", \"SNAPSHOT\"],\n          \"description\": \"CDC operation type\"\n        },\n        \"operation_timestamp\": {\n          \"type\": \"string\",\n          \"format\": \"date-time\",\n          \"description\": \"When change occurred in source\"\n        },\n        \"schema_version\": {\n          \"type\": \"string\"\n        },\n        \"partition_keys\": {\n          \"type\": \"object\",\n          \"description\": \"Date, source, etc. for partitioning\"\n        },\n        \"checksum\": {\n          \"type\": \"string\",\n          \"description\": \"MD5/SHA256 of payload for deduplication\"\n        }\n      }\n    },\n    \n    \"payload\": {\n      \"oneOf\": [\n        {\n          \"type\": \"object\",\n          \"description\": \"Structured data - store as JSON\",\n          \"properties\": {\n            \"data\": {\n              \"type\": \"object\",\n              \"description\": \"Actual row/document data\"\n            },\n            \"before_image\": {\n              \"type\": \"object\",\n              \"description\": \"Previous state for CDC updates\"\n            }\n          }\n        },\n        {\n          \"type\": \"object\",\n          \"description\": \"Unstructured data - reference pattern\",\n          \"required\": [\"storage_path\", \"media_type\"],\n          \"properties\": {\n            \"storage_path\": {\n              \"type\": \"string\",\n              \"description\": \"S3/ADLS path to actual file\"\n            },\n            \"media_type\": {\n              \"type\": \"string\",\n              \"enum\": [\"pdf\", \"docx\", \"html\", \"image\", \"video\", \"audio\"]\n            },\n            \"file_size_bytes\": {\n              \"type\": \"integer\"\n            },\n            \"extracted_metadata\": {\n              \"type\": \"object\",\n              \"description\": \"File properties, EXIF data, etc.\"\n            },\n            \"preview_text\": {\n              \"type\": \"string\",\n              \"description\": \"First 1000 chars for quick search\"\n            }\n          }\n        },\n        {\n          \"type\": \"object\",\n          \"description\": \"IoT/streaming data\",\n          \"required\": [\"device_id\", \"measurements\"],\n          \"properties\": {\n            \"device_id\": {\n              \"type\": \"string\"\n            },\n            \"measurements\": {\n              \"type\": \"object\",\n              \"description\": \"Sensor readings as key-value\"\n            },\n            \"event_sequence\": {\n              \"type\": \"integer\"\n            }\n          }\n        }\n      ]\n    }\n  }\n} \n```"}
